  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il découpe ses ennemis avec ses griffes\nacérées et les terrasse avec ses\nenchaînements de coups hyper fluides.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In fights, they dominate with onslaughts\nof flowing, continuous attacks. With\ntheir sharp claws, they cut enemies.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il emploie des enchaînements élégants.\nLorsqu’il se concentre, leur vitesse\net leur tranchant augmentent.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They have mastered elegant combos.\nAs they concentrate, their battle moves\nbecome swifter and more precise.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It takes pride in the speed at which it\ncan use moves. What it loses in power,\nit makes up for in quantity.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It takes pride in the speed at which it\ncan use moves. What it loses in power,\nit makes up for in quantity.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "わざをくりだす　スピードが　じまん。\nたとえ　パワーは　ひくくても\nてかずの　おおさで　カバーする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "기술을 내보내는 스피드가 자랑이다.\n설령 파워는 낮더라도\n많은 공격 횟수로 커버한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se flatte d’être très rapide. Pour compenser la\nfaiblesse de ses coups, il en assène un très grand\nnombre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Schnelle Angriffe sind seine Spezialität. Es gleicht\nseine Schwächen mit der Vielfalt seines\nAttackenrepertoires aus.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La velocidad de sus ataques es su gran orgullo. Lo\nque le falta de fuerza bruta lo compensa en cantidad\nde golpes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Va fiero della rapidità delle sue mosse. Sopperisce\na un’eventuale mancanza di potenza con il numero\ndei colpi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It takes pride in the speed at which it can use\nmoves. What it loses in power, it makes up for\nin quantity.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
